4	// Don't retry requests that failed due to authentication errors.
5	// The auth interceptor in connect.ts already handles token refresh and request retry.
6	// If the interceptor still throws Unauthenticated, the session is truly gone and the
7	// user will be redirected to /auth. A React Query retry would only fire a second
